【来源1】{"claim": "John is currently considering sports brands like Nike and Under Armour for collaboration.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-15T17:08:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! I'm really excited about this new journey! I'm currently considering sports brands like Nike and Under Armour. It would be great to collaborate with brands that are related to sports. However, I'm also open to exploring other brands that align with my values and interests. There are so many options out there, and I can't wait to see where this takes me!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "John is open to exploring other brands that align with his values and interests, beyond sports brands.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-15T17:08:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! I'm really excited about this new journey! I'm currently considering sports brands like Nike and Under Armour. It would be great to collaborate with brands that are related to sports. However, I'm also open to exploring other brands that align with my values and interests. There are so many options out there, and I can't wait to see where this takes me!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "John's team encourages him when he is down, not only in his sport but also in other aspects of life, and they hang out a lot.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "John: Definitely! They encourage me when I'm down too. It's not just in my sport, but in other aspects of life too. We hang out a lot and it's great having that bond.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "John describes his team as being like a family away from home, with members who push each other to improve.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! You nailed it! Having a strong team/support is key - it's like a family away from home. We push each other to improve, and I'm so thankful for them.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "John's team pulled off a tough win in the basketball game.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a group of men sitting on top of a basketball court] Thank you! Scoring those points was an incredible experience. The atmosphere was electric, and my teammates and I were thrilled. We pulled off a tough win!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "John says being surrounded by equally passionate teammates creates a strong bond, they push each other to be their best, and it feels like having a second family.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a rack of basketball jerseys in a store] Definitely! Being surrounded by teammates who are equally passionate creates a strong bond. We push each other to be our best and the love for the game is infectious. It's like having a second family.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Tim says having a supportive team like another family helps with his home life and hobbies.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Tim", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "Tim: Yeah, having another family is great. It definitely helps with my home life and hobbies.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "John values his team's strong bond, saying it makes all the hard work worth it.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "John: Our team bond is awesome and it makes all the hard work worth it.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "John says playing basketball is an awesome feeling and he gives it his all every time he is on the court.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-15T17:08:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! That was from a game I just played. I was in it! It was awesome being out there, doing what I love. Such an awesome feeling.", "context_only": false}, {"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-15T17:08:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! It's a blast. Giving it my all every time I'm on the court. Really appreciate your support!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "John played in a basketball game last week (relative to 2023-08-09) that was crazy intense, and his team won by a tight score.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a basketball game being played in a large arena] Hi Tim! Nice to hear from you. Glad you could reconnect. As for me, lots of stuff happened since we last talked. Last week I had a crazy game - crazy intense! We won it by a tight score. Scoring that last basket and hearing the crowd cheer was awesome!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Last week", "start": "2023-07-31", "end_exclusive": "2023-08-07", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "John connected with big companies by using his contacts in the basketball industry and his marketing skills, noting that networking plays a big role in getting endorsements.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a basketball card with a picture of a man holding a basketball] I used my contacts in the basketball industry and my marketing skills to make connections. Networking plays a big role in getting endorsements, and I'm grateful for the support I've received.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "John has always liked Under Armour and would find working with them really cool.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a mannequin in a blue suit and a chair] Thanks! The Nike and Gatorade deals have me stoked! I've always liked Under Armour, working with them would be really cool.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "John signed a deal with Nike for a basketball shoe and gear deal.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: I just signed up Nike for a basketball shoe and gear deal. I'm also in talks with Gatorade about a potential sponsorship. It's pretty cool to be working with such big brands!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "John shared a photo of a basketball game being played in a gym, from a recent game.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "observed", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-06-15T17:08:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a basketball game being played in a gym] That sounds awesome! So cool that you get to immerse yourself in that world. So glad you found something that brings you so much joy. Keep diving in and enjoying it! Here's a pic from a recent game.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "John is headed to Seattle and is excited for his basketball game there next month.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-07-16T16:21:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a crowd of people watching a basketball game] It's Seattle, I'm stoked for my game there next month! It's one of my favorite cities to explore - super vibrant!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "next month", "start": "2023-08-01", "end_exclusive": "2023-09-01", "precision": "month", "rule": "source_relative_month"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "John shared only one photo from the basketball game.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-08-09T10:29:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks! It was an amazing rush and just the one I showed you. We were so hyped!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "John reports that things are going well with the new team, that the team has been really nice, and that he is having fun.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-21T19:48:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a bench in a locker with several lockers behind it] Things are going well! The team has been really nice and I'm having fun. How's your fan project coming along?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
